0:01:28.08,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,gaDialogue: 2,0:01:27.78,0:01:28.25,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 2,0:01:27.95,0:01:28.47,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,woDialogue: 2,0:01:28.17,0:01:28.77,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,taDialogue: 2,0:01:28.47,0:01:29.04,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,baDialogue: 2,0:01:28.74,0:01:29.40,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,neDialogue: 2,0:01:29.06,0:01:30.29,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,teDialogue: 1,0:01:29.39,0:01:30.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 1,0:01:29.40,0:01:29.99,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 1,0:01:29.40,0:01:29.99,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 1,0:01:29.40,0:01:30.13,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 1,0:01:29.40,0:01:30.13,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 1,0:01:29.40,0:01:30.54,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,bDialogue: 1,0:01:29.40,0:01:30.54,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:01:29.40,0:01:30.76,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.40,0:01:30.76,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:01:29.40,0:01:30.76,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.41,0:01:30.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 1,0:01:29.56,0:01:31.01,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 1,0:01:29.59,0:01:31.01,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:29.61,0:01:31.01,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:01:29.64,0:01:31.01,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:29.66,0:01:31.01,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.69,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.71,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:29.74,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:29.76,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 1,0:01:29.79,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.81,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.84,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:29.89,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:34.91,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,and keep on going through the hard knock days.Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.91,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:01:29.99,0:01:30.43,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.13,0:01:30.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.37,0:01:30.84,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,muDialogue: 2,0:01:30.54,0:01:31.06,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,beDialogue: 2,0:01:30.76,0:01:31.31,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kiDialogue: 2,0:01:31.01,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,hardDialogue: 2,0:01:31.37,0:01:32.07,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,knockDialogue: 2,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.83,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,daysDialogue: 0,0:01:42.66,0:01:46.13,Title,,0,0,240,,The Island of Fate: MinionDialogue: 0,0:01:52.34,0:01:55.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?! And since when can you talk?!Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.66,0:01:57.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Since always.Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.88,0:02:03.30,Main,,0,0,0,,So you've been... fooling Doflamingo all this time?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.91,0:02:09.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I never claimed that I'd become a mute. He just assumed so.Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:12.78,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the same as fooling him!Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.78,0:02:13.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:14.55,Main,,0,0,650,,Hey now...Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.64,0:02:16.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Silent!Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.92,0:02:28.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.75,0:02:33.62,Main,,0,0,0,,The noise in the streets is gone!Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:34.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.35,0:02:38.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I can see people talking, but I can't hear anything!Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.87,0:02:41.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I put up a wall because you were being noisy.Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.75,0:02:42.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:43.66,Main,,0,0,0,,A sound-proof wall.Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.42,0:02:47.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't hear sound from out there, right?Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.38,0:02:50.38,Main,,0,0,0,,They can't hear us, either.Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:53.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I ate the Calm Fruit. I'm a soundless man.Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:58.16,Main,,0,0,0,,A Devil Fruit user?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.38,0:03:03.31,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell?! Everything about you is a lie!Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.31,0:03:06.76,Main,,0,0,0,,So does that mean? Your idiotic clumsiness...Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:10.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.77,0:03:12.49,Main,,0,0,0,,It's all acting.Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.49,0:03:14.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't lie! Your shoulder's on fire!Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.73,0:03:20.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I've always been clumsy. There's nothing for it, I'm just a klutz.Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.98,0:03:24.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! The most unbelievable part about you is the only thing that's real?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.52,0:03:27.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you hiding all this from your friends?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:29.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't consider them my friends.Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.09,0:03:35.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What I'm trying to do is stop my big brother Doffy from going out of control.Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.05,0:03:41.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know how that beast was born from our warm-hearted parents.Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:49.12,Main,,0,0,0,,He's... inhuman.Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.74,0:03:52.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Help!Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.87,0:03:58.28,Main,,0,0,0,,My children have done nothing wrong!Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.28,0:04:00.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Aim your arrows at me instead!Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.77,0:04:05.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Please! Don't harm my children!Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.00,0:04:11.24,Main,,0,0,0,,It hurts, Father! I can't take it anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.97,0:04:15.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll get even with you bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:18.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother...Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.52,0:04:21.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't die!Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:32.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna survive, no matter what you do to me, and I will...Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.68,0:04:38.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I will come back and murder every single one of you jerks!Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:43.28,Main,,0,0,0,,He's evil by nature, and he doesn't fear anything.Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:48.98,Main,,0,0,0,,The only people who know how brutal Doffy truly is...Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.65,0:04:52.04,Main,,0,0,0,,are the four commanders, including myself,Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.62,0:04:55.26,Main,,0,0,0,,and Vergo, the previous Corazón.Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:57.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Vergo?Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:05:02.69,Main,,0,0,0,,A strong member of the Family, who's currently working alone on a secret mission of some sort.Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.18,0:05:06.42,Main,,0,0,0,,The details of the mission were kept secret from even the Family.Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.42,0:05:08.75,Main,,0,0,0,,He has nothing to do with you.Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.13,0:05:12.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't become a beast like my brother!Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:14.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Get outta here, Law!Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.36,0:05:18.24,Main,,0,0,0,,No way! I want to be like that!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.24,0:05:20.76,Main,,0,0,0,,The secret name "D"...  It's no mistake.Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.26,0:05:24.24,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a part of that fated family — the Family of D.Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:28.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Back in my homeland, children are disciplined with stories...Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.09,0:05:32.66,Main,,0,0,0,,"A misbehaving child will be eaten up by D."Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:38.92,Main,,0,0,0,,People with the name "D" often end up becoming infamous.Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.89,0:05:43.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Old people will frown and mutter...Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.18,0:05:48.07,Main,,0,0,0,,"D is sure to cause another storm."Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:52.59,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?! Am I some kind of monster?Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.59,0:05:53.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe.Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.23,0:05:56.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows the real reason behind it,Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.75,0:06:01.74,Main,,0,0,0,,but that name has been ceaselessly and secretly inherited throughout history all across the world.Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.74,0:06:07.28,Main,,0,0,0,,And in a certain land, there are people who call the Family of "D"...Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:11.65,Main,,0,0,0,,"The sworn enemy of the gods"!Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:17.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Gods?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:21.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Assuming that "gods" refers to the Celestial Dragons,Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:25.30,Main,,0,0,0,,your family's goal might be the destruction of this world.Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.83,0:06:32.44,Main,,0,0,0,,But it's an entirely different kind of destruction from what Doffy wants.Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:36.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Ds must have an ideal opposed to that of the gods.Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:40.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about!Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.39,0:06:44.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I joined the Family to kill every single person as violently as possible!Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.78,0:06:48.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not your subordinate! I'm Doflamingo's subordinate!Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.62,0:06:52.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die in a year! What am I to do if I get out of here?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.42,0:06:54.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of here and look for a cure!Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.57,0:06:55.56,Main,,0,0,0,,There is none!Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:07:00.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna tell Doflamingo that you can talk, and about your ability and everything!Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.98,0:07:01.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.75,0:07:05.13,Main,,0,0,0,,You've got much worse than banishment coming!Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.13,0:07:06.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn brat!Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.96,0:07:14.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I've become stronger in the last two years!Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.17,0:07:15.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Serves you right!Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.53,0:07:21.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Law! You broke the blood law again!Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.79,0:07:25.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, I saw your mouths moving... What were you doing?Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:27.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll buy you an ice cream, so keep quiet.Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.78,0:07:30.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I want the king size that costs 500 belly-dasuyan!Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.97,0:07:32.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Baby 5, lend me some money.Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.74,0:07:33.74,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:35.72,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:39.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Blush! He needs me!Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.16,0:07:45.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this it?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:55.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:59.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I trusted that little brat and told him everything!Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:02.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Corazón!Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.29,0:08:05.88,Main,,0,0,0,,We gotta set sail! It's Tsuru from Navy HQ again!Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:07.86,Main,,0,0,0,,The Navy has found us!Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.39,0:08:11.38,Main,,0,0,0,,He... hasn't told him yet?Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.05,0:08:14.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I decided not to tell him.Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:17.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I realized...Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:20.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I owe you for keeping quiet about me stabbing you two years ago.Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.50,0:08:23.08,Main,,0,0,0,,We're even now.Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:27.85,Note,,0,0,0,,Sail: TsuruDialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:36.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are Corazón and Law?Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:40.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I saw them on board. Aren't they here?Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.60,0:08:52.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Young master! I found this in Corazón's hammock.Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.94,0:08:54.56,Captions,,0,0,0,,I've  left  toDialogue: 0,0:08:52.94,0:08:54.56,Captions,,0,0,0,,cure Law's diseaseDialogue: 0,0:08:54.15,0:08:56.77,Main,,0,0,0,,They packed their things and left, it seems.Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:08:58.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What is he thinking?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.26,0:09:06.08,Main,,0,0,0,,This is kidnapping!Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.16,0:09:09.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, pick up the Snail Phone!Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.82,0:09:11.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it Doflamingo?! I'll talk!Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.58,0:09:13.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Pick it up!Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.51,0:09:15.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I said pick it up! Pick it up!Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.63,0:09:17.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo! Help!Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.84,0:09:20.24,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do to me?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:21.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.13,0:09:29.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you calling Doflamingo?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.03,0:09:31.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Help me!Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.04,0:09:36.96,Main,,0,0,0,,"Rice-cracker pellets". It's me.Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.96,0:09:39.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Rosinante?Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.80,0:09:41.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm taking leave from my mission for a while.Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.89,0:09:48.42,Note,,0,0,0,,Sign: NavyDialogue: 0,0:09:50.30,0:09:55.17,Secondary,,0,0,0,,REIGNING JUSTICEDialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:52.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you in trouble?Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.52,0:09:53.97,Main,,0,0,0,,No, it's personal.Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.97,0:09:55.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it.Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:09:57.81,Main,,0,0,0,,How are the kids?Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.81,0:10:00.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Are they still there despite you giving them a hard time?Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:02.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think those three will leave...Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.95,0:10:07.82,Main,,0,0,0,,The Family's become quite infamous now. Be careful.Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.82,0:10:08.52,Main,,0,0,3,,Yes, Sir.Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.06,0:10:11.54,Captions,,0,0,240,,Navy HQ Admiral SengokuDialogue: 0,0:10:11.72,0:10:15.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I entrust this case to you, so do as you wish.Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.92,0:10:17.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep me updated.Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.77,0:10:20.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger that. I'll send you the details in writing.Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.97,0:10:31.69,Captions,,0,0,240,,Commander Donquixote RosinanteDialogue: 0,0:10:32.47,0:10:33.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Admiral Sengoku!Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.01,0:10:38.00,Captions,,0,0,0,,BuddhaDialogue: 0,0:10:34.64,0:10:37.14,Main,,0,0,0,,The man requesting transfer, who I mentioned the other day, is here.Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:39.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright. Come in.Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.14,0:10:43.66,Main,,0,0,0,,So it's you.Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:46.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been hearing about you.Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.39,0:10:50.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I hear you've done a lot of important work in the past year since you officially joined.Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.50,0:10:53.41,Main,,0,0,0,,So you want to transfer to G-5, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.41,0:10:57.70,Main,,0,0,0,,First of all, I want to ask you about the sunny-side up egg on your left cheek...Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.70,0:10:59.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Sir! My name is Vergo, Sir!Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:04.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Where were you calling just now?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.81,0:11:09.46,Main,,0,0,0,,You said "mission"! Are you a marine or something?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.46,0:11:11.02,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't like marines?Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:13.56,Main,,0,0,0,,People tied to the Government make me sick!Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:15.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not a marine.Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:16.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:19.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! I don't wanna go to the hospital!Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.62,0:11:22.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop acting like some normal kid!Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:24.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna cure your disease!Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.49,0:11:27.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take you to every single hospital!Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.90,0:11:31.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! It's a big hospital! I'm sure they can cure you!Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:34.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh... White Lead Disease?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.64,0:11:38.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been around for a while now. Don't you have a good medicine for it, Doc?Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.21,0:11:41.80,Main,,0,0,0,,E-E-Excuse me, but where are you from?Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.72,0:11:43.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Flevance.Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:45.30,Main,,0,0,0,,The White Town!Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:48.24,Main,,0,0,0,,No! I'm gonna get infected!Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:51.65,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Bring me antiseptic and gloves and a gas mask now!Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.65,0:11:55.09,Main,,0,0,0,,And call security and the Government! Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.09,0:11:57.48,Secondary,,0,0,77,,N-no! Nooo!Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.32,0:11:57.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Forget it!Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.52,0:11:58.98,Secondary,,0,0,77,,No! No! No! No!Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:11:59.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Law!Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:00.62,Secondary,,0,0,77,,Nooo!Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.33,0:12:01.96,Main,,0,0,0,,See?! I'm not even a human anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.60,0:12:12.69,Main,,0,0,0,,White monster! Please leave! I beg you!Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:17.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! How dare you bring a kid like that here?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.38,0:12:20.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you realize how many patients we have?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:22.13,Main,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency announcement.Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.13,0:12:25.37,Main,,0,0,0,,We have a child with White Lead Disease in the hospital.Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:32.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That big guy's violent!Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.46,0:12:34.50,Main,,0,0,0,,We are now sterilizing the entire building.Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.23,0:12:38.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That was the worst hospital ever!Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.44,0:12:42.11,Main,,0,0,0,,My bad. That must have brought back painful memories.Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.11,0:12:45.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you so! I don't wanna go to a hospital!Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:49.01,Main,,0,0,0,,That one was terrible...Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.51,0:12:51.79,Main,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure there'll be a good doctor in the next one!Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.79,0:12:53.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna go!Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.30,0:12:58.33,Main,,0,0,0,,White Lead Disease! No! Somebody, help!Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.33,0:13:00.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a survivor from the White Town!Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.19,0:13:04.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the next! You'll get cured in the next one!Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:06.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Enough! I don't wanna go!Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.40,0:13:08.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Hello?! World Government?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.15,0:13:09.83,Main,,0,0,0,,We have a survivor from Flevance here!Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.83,0:13:11.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you kill all of them?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:14.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Look, Law! People in this town look kind!Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:15.84,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.84,0:13:18.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Ugh! I'm gonna get infected! Go away!Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.94,0:13:22.08,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you call yourself a doctor?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.78,0:13:23.44,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Eight hospitals were damaged.Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:23.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Which way did those two go?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.74,0:13:25.63,Secondary,,0,0,0,,The boy with the disease is...Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.63,0:13:30.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Corazón, I'm not getting better at all... You're just making it worse for me!Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.39,0:13:33.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop whining! You'll get cured in the next one!Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.22,0:13:36.87,Main,,0,0,0,,It's either find the cure or death!  Your life is on the line now!Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.87,0:13:38.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay strong!Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:39.84,Main,,0,0,0,,White Lead Disease!Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.84,0:13:42.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Close the hospital! They're gonna come in!Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.03,0:13:45.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill all y'all!Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:46.47,Main,,0,0,0,,No, Corazón!Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:48.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Corazón!Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:59.35,Captions,,0,0,170,,Six months laterDialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:08.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What am I doing?Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.79,0:14:13.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been making the kid from that tragic town relive the tragedy over and over...Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:16.82,Main,,0,0,0,,And he hasn't gotten any better...Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.27,0:14:19.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Am I doing it for "D"?Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.62,0:14:23.61,Main,,0,0,0,,No... I don't care about that anymore.Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:28.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I just... I just feel real bad for him...Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.84,0:14:31.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you don't want...Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.95,0:14:34.84,Main,,0,0,0,,this idiot who just keeps hurting you...Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:38.61,Main,,0,0,0,,to say something like this but...Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.80,0:14:43.28,Main,,0,0,0,,You're still a rude little boy...Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.41,0:14:46.73,Main,,0,0,0,,and hearing you say "I'll die soon" is...Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.73,0:14:48.27,Main,,0,0,0,,heartbreaking.Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.27,0:14:53.44,Main,,0,0,0,,You... stabbed me... that day, but...Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.78,0:14:56.56,Main,,0,0,0,,it didn't hurt at all!Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:15:00.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I know you were the one who was in pain!Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.66,0:15:03.81,Main,,0,0,0,,You poor thing!Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.18,0:15:04.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Law!Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:25.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Cora-san...Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.47,0:15:28.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cora-san!Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.70,0:15:32.22,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with your face?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.48,0:15:36.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You just called me Cora-san...Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.56,0:15:38.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Just pick up the Snail Phone!Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.98,0:15:44.19,Main,,0,0,0,,It's me, Corazón.Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:52.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Corazón, you're there, aren't you?Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.03,0:16:00.76,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been six months since you two left.Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.14,0:16:02.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Is Law with you?Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:05.74,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.44,0:16:18.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. I'm glad both of you are fine.Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.43,0:16:20.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you found a good doctor?Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.86,0:16:24.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought not.Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.65,0:16:28.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring Law back to the ship.Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:31.57,Main,,0,0,0,,We might be able to cure the disease.Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.29,0:16:37.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I received information about the Operation Fruit.Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.88,0:16:42.58,Main,,0,0,0,,The Navy offered a huge sum of cash in a trade with some pirates...Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.58,0:16:47.95,Main,,0,0,0,,who are too stupid to know its real value, it seems.Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.95,0:16:52.10,Main,,0,0,0,,The Government must be pulling strings behind the scenes.Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.42,0:16:54.36,Main,,0,0,0,,It's risky, but we'll seize it.Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:17:01.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Due to the nature of its power, once we have it...Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.25,0:17:05.67,Main,,0,0,0,,the person I trust the most should eat it.Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.77,0:17:10.68,Main,,0,0,0,,You eat it, Corazón.Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.60,0:17:15.25,Main,,0,0,0,,And cure Law's disease.Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.98,0:17:24.69,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you guys think?Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.69,0:17:28.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Even including Tsuru who often smelled us out,Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.26,0:17:32.73,Main,,0,0,0,,found us, and came after us,Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:38.03,Main,,0,0,0,,the Navy hasn't showed their face at all in the past six months.Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.03,0:17:41.87,Main,,0,0,0,,The same six months that Corazón has been away.Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:46.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that he was tipping the Navy off before?Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.23,0:17:49.71,Main,,0,0,0,,It could be just a coincidence.Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:55.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I hope so. I don't want to distrust him...Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:58.21,Main,,0,0,0,,He's my brother, after all.Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:02.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Good news! Law!Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.28,0:18:07.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You have a chance to survive! Forget about the doctors!Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.82,0:18:12.44,Main,,0,0,0,,If we can get the Operation Fruit, we'd be able to cure your White Lead Disease!Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.14,0:18:14.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the Operation Fruit?Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.27,0:18:16.88,Main,,0,0,0,,It gives you the ability to modify human bodies!Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.88,0:18:20.11,Main,,0,0,0,,You can perform miraculous operations and cure unknown diseases with it!Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.27,0:18:23.65,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Sounds like magic.Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.65,0:18:28.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes! But it's not magic! You need medical knowledge!Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:37.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I know that you're the son of a doctor who was trusted by the people of Flevance!Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.93,0:18:41.73,Main,,0,0,0,,So, it's perfect for you!Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.73,0:18:44.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Me?! Doflamingo said you should eat it!Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.68,0:18:51.86,Main,,0,0,0,,A person will die if he eats two Devil Fruits.Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.90,0:18:57.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Doffy said that because he doesn't know that I'm a Devil Fruit user.Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.12,0:19:02.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Neither of us is ever going back to the Family!Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.53,0:19:14.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I decided that after realizing that this journey would be a long one.Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:20.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Doffy probably knows that I'm a traitor by now.Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.49,0:19:26.88,Main,,0,0,0,,But he didn't seem suspicious. He said you should eat it...Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.88,0:19:31.72,Main,,0,0,0,,There is another reason for Doffy to say he wants me to eat the Operation Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.51,0:19:36.92,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Doffy...Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:39.12,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Because I'm loyal,Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.49,0:19:42.29,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,you're looking to have eternal life in exchange for my life, aren't you?Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.87,0:19:44.81,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll be killed if I go back!Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.52,0:19:51.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen, we'll get a jump on Doffy and the others and steal the Operation Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.34,0:19:53.86,Main,,0,0,0,,You eat the Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.47,0:19:58.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Once you're cured, we'll run away somewhere!Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.41,0:20:05.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Prepare to set sail! We'll get the Operation Fruit at any cost!Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.20,0:20:12.83,Main,,0,0,0,,"Rice crackers"!Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.83,0:20:14.32,Main,,0,0,0,,"Rice-cracker pellets". It's me.Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:18.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Rosinante! It's been a while. I've been worried about you!Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.73,0:20:20.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Garp! Get out for a bit!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.53,0:20:25.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! I just brought you crackers! Put some tea on for me!Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.71,0:20:27.40,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Garp...Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.40,0:20:30.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Should I call you later instead, Sengoku-san?Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.11,0:20:35.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out! Idiot! I gotta work! W-O-R-K!Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.18,0:20:39.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kuzan! Do you wanna snack on some crackers with me?Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.95,0:20:42.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Um... Can I talk?Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.84,0:20:44.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry. Go ahead.Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:47.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it true that you've made a deal for the Operation Fruit?Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.60,0:20:53.56,Main,,0,0,0,,H-How did you know?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.56,0:20:55.67,Main,,0,0,0,,My brother has found out.Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.67,0:20:59.37,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! But it's top secret!Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.22,0:21:03.27,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Cora-san must be talking to...Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.27,0:21:06.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna know those pirates' activities.Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.58,0:21:10.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think we can find them before the trade...Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.35,0:21:15.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if Doflamingo is looking to steal the Operation Fruit before the trade?Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.65,0:21:17.15,Main,,0,0,0,,He is?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.15,0:21:18.78,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Oh? Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.29,0:21:22.52,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I feel kind of dizzy...Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.85,0:21:24.70,Main,,0,0,0,,When and where will the trade be?Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.40,0:21:28.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Three weeks from now, at Rubeck in North Blue.Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.66,0:21:31.10,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Rubeck...Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.10,0:21:38.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Doffy wants me to meet up with him and the others at Swallow Island three days before the trade.Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.18,0:21:39.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Three days before, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:44.98,Main,,0,0,0,,So I guess all of the Family members will be there, ready for battle.Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.29,0:21:46.95,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a good tip.Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.95,0:21:51.95,Main,,0,0,0,,That'll be it for Doflamingo! We'll wait for him at Swallow IslandDialogue: 0,0:21:51.95,0:21:55.58,Main,,0,0,0,,and ambush him, catching the entire Donquixote Family in one fell swoop!Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.05,0:21:58.03,Main,,0,0,0,,You stay away from the island!Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.92,0:22:00.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I was planning on it.Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.44,0:22:06.83,Main,,0,0,0,,The list of all Doffy's business partners and the big shots connected with him behind the scenes...Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:09.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll give it to you sometime soon.Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.05,0:22:14.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I think it'll be more than enough for you to uncover the dark side of the North Blue.Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.84,0:22:16.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay. Thank you.Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.49,0:22:22.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Law. Are you ready?Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.19,0:22:23.32,Main,,0,0,0,,We gotta sail out...Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.02,0:22:25.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Law!Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.42,0:22:29.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait! You gotta be kidding! Stay with me!Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.90,0:22:34.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Not now! We finally have a chance!Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.00,0:22:36.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not been three years yet!Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.21,0:22:38.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you still had time left according to your calculation!Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.54,0:22:42.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no! He has a very high fever! What should I do?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.61,0:22:45.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Doctors are all useless!Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.11,0:22:49.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! What am I supposed to do?! Tell me, Law!Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.26,0:22:50.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Please make it!Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.92,0:22:54.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay alive for another three weeks!Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.75,0:22:57.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me a chance!Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.47,0:23:11.37,Captions,,0,0,175,,Three days before the tradeDialogue: 0,0:23:04.08,0:23:06.98,Main,,0,0,3,,Dammit! Why does it have to be so choppy now?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.38,0:23:08.89,Main,,0,0,3,,Cora-san...Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.89,0:23:11.37,Main,,0,0,3,,Huh? What's wrong, Law?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.37,0:23:16.07,Main,,0,0,0,,The Government knew that we would die...Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.07,0:23:19.21,Main,,0,0,0,,But they kept making us dig up White Lead, for money!Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.47,0:23:23.88,Main,,0,0,0,,My family... and the people of Flevance...Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.98,0:23:27.25,Main,,0,0,0,,The Government killed them!Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.16,0:23:36.04,Main,,0,0,0,,So if you're a marine allied with them,Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.04,0:23:37.83,Main,,0,0,0,,tell me the truth.Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.83,0:23:41.37,Main,,0,0,0,,That's absurd! I'm not a marine!Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.10,0:23:45.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Good!Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.44,0:23:49.11,Main,,0,0,0,,In fact... You need to realize...Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.11,0:23:51.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Stealing the Operation Fruit means...Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.71,0:23:56.56,Main,,0,0,0,,we'll make enemies of everybody... Doflamingo, the Navy, and the Government!Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.97,0:23:59.26,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll be chased by all of them!Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:02.60,Main,,0,0,0,,You better be prepared to fight for survival!Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.80,0:24:15.55,Captions,,0,0,170,,Minion IslandDialogue: 0,0:24:10.18,0:24:13.50,Main,,0,0,3,,Have you found the pirates, Sengoku-san?Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.50,0:24:17.57,Main,,0,0,3,,Yeah. East of Rubeck where we're making the deal...Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.57,0:24:21.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Minion Island's there, with a ghost town.Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.47,0:24:24.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like that's where their hideout is.Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.21,0:24:29.48,Main,,0,0,0,,The pirate's name is Diez Barrels. Sound familiar?Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.48,0:24:32.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's a former Navy officer...Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.23,0:24:33.64,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.47,0:24:38.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Our scout-ship is staking out Minion Island now.Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.78,0:24:47.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, at Swallow Island where you and Doflamingo were going to meet up,Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.23,0:24:50.57,Main,,0,0,0,,there are two warships.Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.57,0:24:55.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let Doflamingo steal the Operation Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.57,0:25:00.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Law, it won't be long. Wait here...Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.94,0:25:22.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Dray! Booze! Bring more booze!Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.05,0:25:25.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Right away.Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.44,0:25:29.80,Main,,0,0,0,,How much do you think this one fruit would cost?Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.37,0:25:32.10,Main,,0,0,0,,They offered five billion!Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.41,0:25:38.28,Main,,0,0,0,,How ridiculous! Did the Government go nuts?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.28,0:25:43.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Once we got that much money, there's no reason for us to be pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.33,0:25:47.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Right, right!Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.71,0:25:50.78,Main,,0,0,0,,It may sound too simple but...Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.55,0:25:53.39,Main,,0,0,0,,once a doctor eats this,Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.39,0:25:57.30,Main,,0,0,0,,they'll become a famous doctor in great demand all over the world.Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.48,0:26:05.20,Main,,0,0,0,,There was a legendary doctor who ate this and cured intractable or rare diseases...Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.20,0:26:08.14,Main,,0,0,0,,by performing miraculous operations, they say.Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.22,0:26:13.19,Main,,0,0,0,,But it has nothing to do with us!Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.19,0:26:15.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, getting money is way better!Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.05,0:26:16.72,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.10,0:26:24.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at this, Law!Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.33,0:26:28.87,Main,,0,0,0,,This trick makes everything I touch completely soundless!Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.47,0:26:30.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Calm!Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.50,0:26:36.77,Note,,0,0,0,,Silence!Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.64,0:26:39.44,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That face...Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.29,0:26:45.32,Note,,0,0,0,,Silence!Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.72,0:26:46.78,Note,,0,0,0,,Silence!Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.68,0:26:48.45,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Stinks!Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.25,0:26:51.82,Main,,0,0,0,,See? You heard nothing, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.82,0:26:54.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What is that ability good for?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.76,0:26:56.06,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not even cool!Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.02,0:26:59.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Baby 5's Weapon Fruit is much better than that!Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.90,0:27:04.10,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Damn! You're right! I wish I had that power!Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.10,0:27:07.70,Main,,0,0,0,,But no one can have a peaceful rest like me...Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.70,0:27:08.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever!Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.26,0:27:30.19,Main,,0,0,0,,What was that quake?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.33,0:27:36.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain! Th-There wasn't any noise but the compound's exploded!Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.49,0:27:39.44,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! That can't be happening!Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.09,0:27:43.21,Main,,0,0,0,,The treasury is on fire!Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.71,0:27:45.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire now!Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.78,0:27:46.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.31,0:27:52.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Is there an invader?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.78,0:27:55.14,Main,,0,0,0,,The lights went out!Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.14,0:27:56.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Pieces of glass are falling onto us!Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.59,0:27:59.22,Main,,0,0,0,,The lamps! The lamps are broken!Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.36,0:28:03.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Somebody! Somebody put on a light...Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.96,0:28:07.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and put on a light!Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.98,0:28:26.22,Note,,0,0,0,,Silence!Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.53,0:28:37.23,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I got it, Law!  It's the Operation Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.06,0:28:41.10,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Your disease will be cured!Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.94,0:28:53.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's this?! He scared me!Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.89,0:28:55.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did he tumble down from?Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.98,0:29:00.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! A guy in a dark coat stole the Operation Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.85,0:29:02.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away!Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.22,0:29:05.42,Main,,0,0,0,,It's him!Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.42,0:29:23.74,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I know it's hard but... wait here for a while.Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.80,0:29:29.04,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll be back in no time.Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.18,0:29:32.08,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,With the Operation Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.95,0:29:39.00,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing: Galaxy 9000  Timing: Datenshi  QC: Mr. Luffy  Soundtracking: Halee  TC/Infoboxes: Datenshi  Original Translation: Yibis